# Build context of containers/Dockerfile (context = repository root). The image needs environment.yml, the R package
# (DESCRIPTION, NAMESPACE, R/, man/, inst/, vignettes/) for R CMD INSTALL and python/ (pyproject.toml, README.md,
# LICENSE, src/) for pip install ./python; everything else stays out.
.git
.github
.gitignore
docs
doc
Meta
pkgdown
recipes
tests
python/tests
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
python/build
python/dist
*.Rcheck
*.tar.gz
.Rproj.user
.Rhistory
.RData
